cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite this repository."
title: "OU + XGBoost for Electricity Price Forecasting"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mohseni Gharyehsafa"
    given-names: "Behnam"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
url: "https://github.com/BehnamMohseniGharyehsafa/ou-xgboost-energy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BehnamMohseniGharyehsafa/ou-xgboost-energy"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A research implementation of next-day UTC daily-average electricity price
  forecasting using causal lagged features, gradient-boosted trees, and a
  conditioned Ornstein-Uhlenbeck expectation, with chronological evaluation.
keywords:
  - electricity price forecasting
  - Ornstein-Uhlenbeck
  - XGBoost
  - stochastic processes
  - energy markets
